␀You cannot see pictures on this device (no image service). Read your own strokes again instead and say honestly what might be wrong.␀You have not drawn a picture yet.␀I (%lu) %s: KI-Bild nachsehen: %d Punkte an die Bilderkennung
␀This is a simple line drawing (colours are not shown). What does it show? Name the main shapes and where they are, in two short sentences.␀Could not look at your picture (␀I (%lu) %s: KI-Bild nachgesehen: %s
␀An image viewer says about YOUR drawing: "␀" Compare it with what you meant to draw. If it does not fit, say briefly what went wrong and offer to draw it again better (self.face.draw_picture).␀You cannot see pictures on this device (no image service). Admire the drawing anyway and ask the user what it shows.␀There is no drawing yet -- ask the user to draw something first (gesture `canvas`).␀Could not look at the picture (␀). Admire it anyway and ask the user what it shows.␀zufaellig␀dance␀I (%lu) %s: Tanzen auf Zuruf
