ende)␀shapeset mandel;eyeshape reset;shapemood off;eyeshape aspectx 0.88;eyeshape aspecty 0.88;shade flat off;shade track on;color 0xA0B830;glow off;light off;pupil on;pupil mode 6;pupil size 0.75;pupil color 0x0A0A0A;pupil alpha 255;pupil dilate on;highlight on;highlight soft off;highlight second off;highlight size 0.12;highlight pos -0.25 -0.30;brows off;mouth on;mouth cat on;mouth whiskers on;shoes model pfote;shoes on;ears cat;ears sphere on;hands paw on;eyenarrow 0.15;shoes ballmodel wolle␀Pillen-Augen (Stadion), massiv hellblau, Roboter-Look␀shapeset pille;eyeshape reset;shapemood off;shade flat on;color 0x40C8FF;glow off;light off;pupil off;pupil shift 0 0;highlight off;brows off;mouth off␀Pixel-Bloecke, fast scharfkantig, gruen (Retro-LED)␀shapeset pixel;eyeshape reset;shapemood off;shade flat on;color green;glow off;light off;pupil off;pupil shift 0 0;highlight off;brows off;mouth off␀Ei-Augen, weiss, runde Pupille mit Glanz (weich, kindlich)␀shapeset ei;eyeshape reset;shapemood off;shade flat on;color white;glow off;light off;pupil on;pupil mode 1;pupil size 0.60;pupil color 0x000000;pupil alpha 255;pupil dilate off;highlight on;highlight soft off;highlight second off;highlight size 0.18;highlight pos -0.30 -0.35;brows off;mouth off␀Sechseck-Augen, orange, eckige dunkle Pupille (technisch)␀shapeset sechseck;eyeshape reset;shapemood off;shade flat on;color orange;glow off;light off;pupil on;pupil mode 5;pupil size 0.40;pupil color 0x1A0A00;pupil alpha 255;pupil dilate off;highlight off;brows off;mouth off␀Otto (Vorlage Nor; umbenannt, Sprache verstand "nor" falsch): hellblaue Box-Augen mit Scanlines, gefuellter Mund␀shapeset box;eyeshape aspectx 1.14;eyeshape aspecty 0.92;shapemood off;shade flat on;color 0x4AA8E0;glow off;light off;highlight off;brows off;mouth on;mouth fill on;mouth anchor bottom;mouth gap 0.12;mouth gap2d 0.22;mouth width 0.56;scan on␀Kapsel-Augen (Vorlage Roboter-Designstudie): hoch, warm-cremeweiss, leuchtend, froehlich als Bogen␀shape